    "pin": {
      "title": "Mespelbrunn Castle",
      "description": "Palace in Mespelbrunn, Germany",
      "extract": "Mespelbrunn Castle is a late-medieval/early-Renaissance moated castle on the territory of the town of Mespelbrunn, between Frankfurt and Würzburg, built in a tributary valley of the Elsava valley, within the Spessart forest. It is a popular tourist attraction and has become a famous Spessart landmark.",
