    "town": {
      "title": "Mespelbrunn",
      "description": "Municipality in Bavaria, Germany",
      "extract": "Mespelbrunn is a municipality in the Aschaffenburg district in the Regierungsbezirk of Lower Franconia (Unterfranken) in Bavaria, Germany and a member of the Verwaltungsgemeinschaft of Mespelbrunn, whose seat is in Heimbuchenthal.",
